A '''Frog's Spirit''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Ability Scroll]].

== Obtaining ==
'''Frog's Spirit''' can be purchased from the [[Forest Essence Shop]] for {{Item|Forest Essence|amount=5000}}.

== Usage ==
A '''Frog's Spirit''' can be applied to {{Item|Canopy Sandals}}, {{Item|Fig Striders}}, or {{Item|Helix Boots}} in an anvil to give them the {{AN|Leapfrog}} ability.

{{AN|Leapfrog}} allows the player to double jump by pressing jump in midair. Double jumps can be used repeatably without landing to fly. Using {{AN|Leapfrog}} costs {{Stat|Mana|25}}. Using {{AN|Leapfrog}} also plays a croaking sound ([[mcw:Frog#Sounds|{{Code|entity.frog.ambient}}]]) and spawns a ring of green particles. 

After being applied, a '''Frog's Spirit''' can be removed using [[The Hex]]. Player's will not receive a refund and the '''Frog's Spirit''' will be destroyed.

